			x: -6.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"The &eYeta Wrench&r rotates machines, configures conduits and picks blocks up intact."
				""
				"&c&lConduits cannot be configured with anything else.&r Trying to set a conduit's input/output with a Create wrench or a Mekanism Configurator does nothing - this is the tool."
				""
				"&7Crouch-clicking with it toggles conduit visibility, which is how you hide a full six-service bundle inside a wall.&r"
			]
			icon: "enderio:yeta_wrench"
