		{
			description: [
				"A &eSoul Binder&r captures a mob's soul into a vial; a &ePowered Spawner&r then spawns that mob from FE."
				""
				"&e&lThis is another void-world answer.&r Capture one blaze, one enderman, one wither skeleton - then spawn them at will on a platform you designed, with no spawner cage and no light-level fiddling."
				""
				"&7Broken Spawner in, Soul Vial in, power applied, and the machine produces that mob continuously. Pair it with a grinder and a collector.&r"
				""
				"&8The Soul Binder is also used to upgrade several Ender IO items, so it earns its space regardless."
			]
