		{
			description: [
				"A &eTravel Anchor&r is a teleport waypoint; looking at one and right-clicking blinks you to it."
				""
				"&e&lThe Staff of Travelling extends the range enormously&r and lets you jump between anchors across your whole island chain."
				""
				"&7Dark Steel armour with the Travel upgrade does the same thing without holding an item - the standard endgame movement setup here.&r"
				""
				"&8Anchors can be named and access-restricted, which matters on a shared server."
