		{
			description: [
				"The &eXP Vacuum&r hoovers experience orbs from a wide radius; the Experience Obelisk stores XP as a fluid you can withdraw."
				""
				"&e&lTogether they turn a mob farm into an enchanting bank.&r Kill mobs anywhere near the vacuum, and the XP accumulates in a tank you can draw from at an anvil."
				""
				"&7Ender IO also has an Aversion Obelisk (stops mobs spawning in a radius) and an Attractor Obelisk (pulls them in) - the two halves of a controlled spawn platform.&r"
			]
			icon: "enderio:xp_vacuum"
