		{
			description: [
				"An &eImpulse Hopper&r moves a complete set of items at once rather than one at a time; a &eWired Charger&r charges any item placed in it from FE."
				""
				"&e&lThe Impulse Hopper is for recipes.&r It waits until it has every ingredient of the set you configured, then moves them together - which stops a crafting machine jamming on a partial set."
				""
				"&7The Wired Charger is the tidiest way to keep Free Runners, jetpacks and a Meka-Tool topped up at base.&r"
