		{
			description: [
				"&eDark Steel&r tools and armour take upgrades at an anvil rather than being fixed at craft time."
				""
				"&e&lThe upgrades worth having:&r &7Empowered&r (I-IV, stores FE and hits harder), &7Spoon&r (pickaxe doubles as shovel), &7Direct&r (mined blocks go straight to inventory), &7Travel&r (anchor teleporting without a staff)."
				""
				"&c&lIt eats obsidian&r, which in a void world means a lava-and-water loop or the Cyclic Melter line. Set that up first."
				""
				"&7Empowered gear runs on stored FE - flat gear is ordinary gear. Keep a Wired Charger at base.&r"
			]
