				"&ePhotovoltaic Cells&r are Ender IO's solar panels, in four tiers."
				""
				"&7They are a reasonable trickle for outposts and they connect straight into energy conduits, but Solar Flux scales considerably further. Build these if you are already deep in Ender IO; build Solar Flux if solar is your plan.&r"
				""
				"&8On a floating island every panel runs unshaded, so whichever you pick performs at its stated maximum."
